   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 Cumulative number of people  (women, men) who completed the Project&apos;s Capacity Development Programme for regional and local authorities
1.2 Cumulative number of local initiatives for crisis response and sustainable recovery developed by the regional and local authorities in the target oblasts 
2.1 Cumulative number of challenge-driven partnerships established and committed to design and implement local initiatives for crisis response and/or sustainable recovery
2.2 Number of completed regional and local initiatives which have been awarded grants
2.3 Cumulative number of people in targeted local communities (women, men) benefiting from implemented local initiatives 
3.1 Number of war affected MSMEs graduating from the distance learning programme in the targeted regions of the project
